# Secret Tunnel's ruling (2025-10-02): if one of the two creatures leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, the other
# still can't be blocked this turn as long as it has a creature type the other had as it left (CR 608.2b, last-known
# information). Bot1 targets Water Tribe Captain and Earth Kingdom Protectors (both Human Soldier Allies); Bot2 kills the
# Captain with Lightning Bolt in response, and the Protectors, still sharing those types with it, can't be blocked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Secret Tunnel
Mox Pearl
